    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Students are encouraged to pursue a homestay option to fully immerse themselves in local American culture via the hospitality of a trusted local family. It also helps to improve a student's English language skills. The Studios on Broadway provide on-campus accommodation for international students and shared housing for nearly 80 students. Some students rent privately with friends or family as the campus is convenient for commuting.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Sports",
      "value": "<p>The South Seattle College Fitness Center is open for student use and contains a fully equipped gym offering various fitness equipment and classes.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Library",
      "value": "<p>The South Seattle College Library is a luxurious facility offering over 60,000 books, periodicals, and electronic resources. Services include research assistance, computer access, and study spaces. A Learning Centre also provides free tutoring and academic support to all South Seattle College students. The student-centered approach empowers students with one-on-one tutoring, study groups and workshops.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
